        <section id="executive-summary">
            <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
            <p>This report presents a comprehensive analysis of global intentional homicide rates from 1990 to 2023, drawing on data from the United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime (UNODC). The analysis reveals a complex picture: while the global median homicide rate has declined over the long term, significant disparities persist across regions, demographics, and individual countries.</p>

            <div class="kpi-grid">
