            <h2>5. Notable Country-Level Trends & Outliers</h2>
            <p>While aggregate trends provide important context, individual country trajectories reveal dramatic improvements and deteriorations that merit attention. These outliers often reflect specific policy interventions, socioeconomic shifts, or political transformations.</p>

