            <p><strong>Ecuador's Surge:</strong> Ecuador has experienced one of the most dramatic deteriorations globally, with homicide rates increasing over 400% since the 1990s. This is primarily attributed to the country's positioning as a transit hub for drug trafficking between Colombia and Mexico.</p>
